---
kind: lore
id: lore.banter
title: Road banter
---
/* One bark per lull on the road (`banter`, select: first). Party-dependent
barks outrank the generic ones; the sharpest reactions outrank everything. */

<entry id="banterGrief" on="banter" category="bark" title="Corvin, alone" priority="60" once="run" when="holds('fell', ['isolde']) && holds('inParty', ['corvin'])">
  @corvin{code="0010"}: Nobody's told me to stop talking in two days. I don't like it.
</entry>

<entry id="banterSold" on="banter" category="bark" title="Isolde, cold" priority="50" once="run" when="run.bridge == 'sold' && holds('inParty', ['isolde']) && holds('inParty', ['corvin'])">
  @isolde{code="0010"}: Corvin. Walk on the other side of the wagon.
  @corvin{code="0010"}: It was the Warden's decision.
  @isolde{code="0020"}: I am aware. I am choosing which of you I can stand to look at.
</entry>

<entry id="banterCrate" on="banter" category="bark" title="Twelve crates" priority="30" once="run" when="holds('inParty', ['isolde']) && holds('inParty', ['corvin']) && !holds('knows', ['ledger'])">
  @corvin{code="0010"}: Twelve crates in the ninth wagon, Vane. The manifest says eleven.
  @isolde{code="0010"}: Then the manifest is wrong.
  @corvin{code="0020"}: Manifests are never wrong. They're just honest about different things.
</entry>

<entry id="banterRiver" on="banter" category="bark" title="Wren and Corvin" priority="35" once="run" when="@wrenWithUs && holds('inParty', ['corvin'])">
  @corvin{code="0010"}: So what's the river saying now?
  @wren{code="0010"}: That you owe it a coin from the ford crossing last spring.
  @corvin{code="0020"}: How does it know that?
  @wren{code="0020"}: How do you think I know that?
</entry>

<entry id="banterOath" on="banter" category="bark" title="Isolde hums" priority="20" once="run" when="quest.isoldeOath.state == 'active' && @wrenWithUs && holds('inParty', ['isolde'])">
  @wren{code="0010"}: What's that you're humming?
  @isolde{code="0010"}: A Coldwater song. I didn't know I still knew it.
</entry>

<entry id="banterLedger" on="banter" category="bark" title="Paper and fire" priority="25" once="run" when="holds('knows', ['ledger']) && holds('inParty', ['isolde'])">
  @isolde{code="0010"}: Coldwater. Pell's Reach. Harrow Top. They wrote the names down, like a shopping list.
  @corvin{code="0010" when="holds('inParty', ['corvin'])"}: Everyone writes it down. That's how you know it was business.
</entry>

<entry id="banterQuiet" on="banter" category="bark" title="The road">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The wheels grind. The mules plod. Somewhere ahead, the black sun on another milestone.
</entry>
